  <sys:String x:Key="AboutWeatherTitle">Weather data</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutWeatherText">Weather and city search are powered by Open-Meteo, a free open API with no keys or sign-up.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutMediaTitle">Music and sound</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutMediaText">Track, artwork and playback come from Windows media sessions. App volumes, output devices and presets use Core Audio. Lyrics — LRCLIB. Live glass — screen capture with the island excluded.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutCalendarTitle">Calendar</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutCalendarText">Upcoming meetings come from your ICS link (Outlook, Google, Yandex). No accounts are requested; the link stays local.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutSystemTitle">System</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutSystemText">CPU, GPU and RAM come from Windows performance counters: GetSystemTimes, GPU Engine, GlobalMemoryStatusEx. No third-party services.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutPrivacyTitle">Privacy</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutPrivacyText">All data lives in %APPDATA%\Island. Only weather and geocoding, lyrics (LRCLIB), your ICS link and GitHub update checks go online. An update is downloaded only after confirmation and SHA-256 verification.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="AboutCredits">Open source · powered by Kain Raine</sys:String>
